# graphify extraction cache
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cost.json
# Dated curated-graph backups written by `graphify update` (YYYY-MM-DD/), every date, not
# just the current one. Explicit digit classes rather than a bare `graphify-out/*/` so real
# output subdirectories added later are still tracked.
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

